{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"herbalist_hut","model_identifier":"herbalist_hut","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# herbalist_hut\n\nHerbalist hut: a round daub cottage under a conical thatch, bunches of herbs drying under the eaves, and a fenced herb garden.\n\n- Footprint: 6 x 6 columns (96 x 96 units, 2.70 x 2.70 m), centred on the origin, front (door side) faces -Z.\n- Finished bounds: x -38..81, y 0..104, z -45..45 units.\n- Texture: 256 x 512, 1 px per unit, square pixels, nearest filtering. Every visible face has its own texture region painted with its material at world position (seams line up across faces); identical faces share a region; construction and ruined pieces map into the region of the face they were cut from. No cube is cut to fit the texture.\n- Cubes: finished 112, construction_0 23, construction_33 28, construction_66 32, ruined 19 (2 rotated: roof slabs and a few leaning props).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- round hut: 64 x 104 x 64 centred at the origin\n\n## State group sets (children of `root`; show exactly one)\n\n- `finished`: the finished building (visible by default).\n- `construction_0`, `construction_33`, `construction_66`: build progress at 0 %, 33 % and 66 % (staked outline and scaffold, then walls rising inside scaffold, then full frame with roof rafters).\n- `ruined`: collapsed shell, broken walls, rubble, fallen roof (use with `_damaged.png`, or `_abandoned.png` for F7 abandoned buildings).\n- `herbalist_hut_damaged.png`: damaged texture (scorch, holes, cracks) for the same UVs; works on every group set.\n- `herbalist_hut_abandoned.png`: abandoned look (damage plus moss, faded cloth, cold fires) = `abandoned_herbalist_hut` together with the `ruined` set or the finished set.\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | what moves |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `working` | 3.0 | loop | herb bunches sway under the eaves. |\n\n## Attachment and effect points (empty groups)\n\n- `slot_door` at (0, 0, -37)\n"},"resolution":{"width":256,"height":512},"elements":[{"name":"found","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-30.0,0.0,-30.0],"to":[30.0,3.0,30.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[90.0,320.0,150.0,323.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[90.0,320.0,150.0,323.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[90.0,320.0,150.0,323.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[90.0,320.0,150.0,323.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[114.0,0.0,174.0,60.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[114.0,0.0,174.0,60.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"bfa11c70-04d5-56bc-a3e4-4465eb0984d7"},{"name":"wall_a","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-28.0,3.0,-11.76],"to":[28.0,56.0,11.76],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[50.0,94.0,106.0,147.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[150.24,94.0,173.76,147.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[50.0,94.0,106.0,147.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[150.24,94.0,173.76,147.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[89.0,230.24,145.0,253.76],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[89.0,230.24,145.0,253.76],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"4cb16cef-fd64-530b-9527-acd3d988dd88"},{"name":"wall_b","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-11.76,3.0,-28.0],"to":[11.76,56.0,28.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[150.24,94.0,173.76,147.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[50.0,94.0,106.0,147.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[150.24,94.0,173.76,147.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[50.0,94.0,106.0,147.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[26.24,94.0,49.76,150.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[26.24,94.0,49.76,150.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"55a5bd09-f7b