ation","data_points":[{"x":-10.0,"y":0.0,"z":0.0}],"uuid":"5e0f12c2-9da1-5cd9-8853-285f3155ff8c","time":2.25,"color":-1,"interpolation":"catmullrom"},{"channel":"rotation","data_points":[{"x":0.0,"y":0.0,"z":0.0}],"uuid":"3ae024ed-2fc6-5190-89e7-fb8d35729408","time":3.0,"color":-1,"interpolation":"catmullrom"}]},"2ff8f2c1-cd3a-5ca3-a14b-ec12339de90b":{"name":"herbs5","type":"bone","keyframes":[{"channel":"rotation","data_points":[{"x":0.0,"y":0.0,"z":0.0}],"uuid":"fd3b77d3-1882-514b-a416-6dd93c30593b","time":0.0,"color":-1,"interpolation":"catmullrom"},{"channel":"rotation","data_points":[{"x":11.0,"y":0.0,"z":0.0}],"uuid":"a358ae6f-30c3-5679-b41a-ba2a9ca224d7","time":0.75,"color":-1,"interpolation":"catmullrom"},{"channel":"rotation","data_points":[{"x":0.0,"y":0.0,"z":0.0}],"uuid":"89503ac0-3a82-5702-889f-b0e603541424","time":1.5,"color":-1,"interpolation":"catmullrom"},{"channel":"rotation","data_points":[{"x":-11.0,"y":0.0,"z":0.0}],"uuid":"add974ce-c52a-5e85-a253-d585aa0cbf33","time":2.25,"color":-1,"interpolation":"catmullrom"},{"channel":"rotation","data_points":[{"x":0.0,"y":0.0,"z":0.0}],"uuid":"ad67d54b-0d8f-5d0d-9682-73dbb97fe80e","time":3.0,"color":-1,"interpolation":"catmullrom"}]}}}],"description":"# herbalist_hut\n\nHerbalist hut: a round daub cottage under a conical thatch, bunches of herbs drying under the eaves, and a fenced herb garden.\n\n- Footprint: 6 x 6 columns (96 x 96 units, 2.70 x 2.70 m), centred on the origin, front (door side) faces -Z.\n- Finished bounds: x -38..81, y 0..104, z -45..45 units.\n- Texture: 256 x 512, 1 px per unit, square pixels, nearest filtering. Every visible face has its own texture region painted with its material at world position (seams line up across faces); identical faces share a region; construction and ruined pieces map into the region of the face they were cut from. No cube is cut to fit the texture.\n- Cubes: finished 112, construction_0 23, construction_33 28, construction_66 32, ruined 19 (2 rotated: roof slabs and a few leaning props).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- round hut: 64 x 104 x 64 centred at the origin\n\n## State group sets (children of `root`; show exactly one)\n\n- `finished`: the finished building (visible by default).\n- `construction_0`, `construction_33`, `construction_66`: build progress at 0 %, 33 % and 66 % (staked outline and scaffold, then walls rising inside scaffold, then full frame with roof rafters).\n- `ruined`: collapsed shell, broken walls, rubble, fallen roof (use with `_damaged.png`, or `_abandoned.png` for F7 abandoned buildings).\n- `herbalist_hut_damaged.png`: damaged texture (scorch, holes, cracks) for the same UVs; works on every group set.\n- `herbalist_hut_abandoned.png`: abandoned look (damage plus moss, faded cloth, cold fires) = `abandoned_herbalist_hut` together with the `ruined` set or the finished set.\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | what moves |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `working` | 3.0 | loop | herb bunches sway under the eaves. |\n\n## Attachment and effect points (empty groups)\n\n- `slot_door` at (0, 0, -37)\n"}